  "traps": [
    "the two units are joined only by openapi/openapi.yaml: the frontend generates its types from it (the gen:api script, a generates connection with no providing unit, since the spec has no build file), the backend implements the same paths by hand with matching operation_id values; neither manifest names the other, so depends_on is empty",
    "openapi.yaml is hand-written: FastAPI serves its own generated schema at /openapi.json, and nothing checks that the two agree",
    "Linguist calls openapi/openapi.yaml OASv3-yaml (heuristic on the openapi: 3.0.3 line), not YAML",
    "frontend/src/api/schema.d.ts is generated by openapi-typescript (header: auto-generated, do not edit) and checked in",
    "uvicorn is declared with the extra [standard]: the package name is uvicorn",
    "pydantic is imported by main.py but not declared: it arrives with fastapi, so it is not a direct dependency",
    "the backend base URL http://localhost:8000 is written only in frontend/src/client.ts",
    "the Makefile at the root is the only thing that runs both sides; it is not a unit"
